{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>If you say in your heart.</b> Perforce it is the sense of דִּילְמָא — that you might say in your heart: because they are numerous I cannot dispossess them — do not say so; <b>do not fear them.</b> And it would not hold to explain it with any of the other senses of כִּי, for then 'do not fear them' would fall upon it again."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:17.580201455Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}